        <span class="item"><span class="sw" style="background:var(--neg)"></span>worse, beyond noise</span>
        <span class="item"><span class="sw" style="background:var(--ink-muted);opacity:.5"></span>within noise</span>
        <span class="item" style="color:var(--ink-muted)">dot area ∝ shots · whisker = 95% CI · dashed = trailing mean</span>
      </div>
      <p class="caption">Only <b>${noise.nSig} of ${noise.n}</b> sessions differ from their own trailing average by more
      than sampling noise. Sessions run from 4 shots to 78 here, and a 4-shot mean can move a long way on luck alone —
      which is why the dots are sized by shot count and the whiskers are drawn at all.</p>`
      :`<p class="empty">Not enough sessions for confidence intervals.</p>`}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="blockhead">
